    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game will also be available in English, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>but will be translated after the Japanese version is released and released at a later date.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/ff21208516da37f9bbe717b020a2f5dd.poster.avif?t=1752971154\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/ff21208516da37f9bbe717b020a2f5dd.webm?t=1752971154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/ff21208516da37f9bbe717b020a2f5dd.mp4?t=1752971154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey of Reincarnation is</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike + auto battle + NES style retro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a combination RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is expected to take about 2-3 hours to reach each ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has also been designed so that players can enjoy different tactics and gameplay experiences through various party formations and skill builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those looking for challenging combat,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the game also offers additional challenge elements such as items that increase the difficulty and\u00a0secret bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins with the protagonist who, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >after an unfortunate death, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >receives mercy in the heavenly </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >realm and chooses a new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The challenge is a dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is a fully automatic battle with no commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters think for themselves, choose the best move, and act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Captivating music written specifically for this world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the NES sound of the late 80s,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the 8-bit style chiptune sound</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >was written entirely by composer &quot;Aomo Akane&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 20 new songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the nostalgic and heart-warming music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u201ckey to success\u201d is the customization of status and skills, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >which can be controlled by the player through the use of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cJewel\u201d that are dropped by monsters or purchased at stores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The formation of the vanguard and rear guard is also important. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/18bbcd0070062eff3f60c3fa469b2e75.poster.avif?t=1752971154\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/18bbcd0070062eff3f60c3fa469b2e75.webm?t=1752971154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/18bbcd0070062eff3f60c3fa469b2e75.mp4?t=1752971154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment that influences the battle situation &quot;Jewel&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are three main types of jewels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Armor Gem&quot; related to defense</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWeapon Gem\u201d related to attacks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Skill Gem&quot; that determines skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u3010Armor Gem\u3011</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make you fight back when attacked by an enemy, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply increase your defense, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and some will prevent status abnormalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u3010Weapon Gem\u3011</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those that increase the number of attacks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increases attack power,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those that add abnormalities to normal attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u3010Skill Gem\u3011</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is attached differently depending on the member's job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Swordsmen], who are good at swords, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cannot attach fighting skill gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you cannot use magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a [Knight], you can also use a spear,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you are good at changes, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >such as being able to use recovery magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/0dc80956648de49f8fb63b7d5888f9b4.avif?t=1752971154\" width=316 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Chain bonus&quot; when allies attack continuously!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an ally's attack hits consecutively, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the &quot;Chain!&quot; and the damage will increase! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the number of chains </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by attacking multiple times or stopping the opponent's actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/c8b61782f876f1f48e06d80a68342d88.avif?t=1752971154\" width=310 height=118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When magic is added to the chain, a &quot;CB : Chain Burst&quot; occurs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, if a magic attack hits during the chain,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the normal magic is classed up and a &quot;<strong>Chain Burst</strong>&quot; occurs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Fire]</strong> would be powered up and activated </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by another magic called <strong>[Explosion]</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this to your advantage and do a lot of damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these systems to your advantage, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >repeatedly reincarnate, and conquer the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>For streamers</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be streamed without application.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for the opportunity to share this game with the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, please include the \u201cgame title\u201d in the video title for spoiler consideration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please respond to requests </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from game creators and game material copyright holders to delete videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is a case of lack of consideration that would be offensive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > to the producer, and is not intended to restrict content.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the F12 screenshot doesn't work properly on Steam, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can improve the situation by going to Game Properties \u2192 Launch Options and entering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot; --in-process-gpu &quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is an unofficial setting that stabilizes operation in some environments.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis game is created using RPG Maker MV.</p>",
