hanges, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >such as being able to use recovery magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/0dc80956648de49f8fb63b7d5888f9b4.avif?t=1752971154\" width=316 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Chain bonus&quot; when allies attack continuously!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an ally's attack hits consecutively, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the &quot;Chain!&quot; and the damage will increase! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the number of chains </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by attacking multiple times or stopping the opponent's actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001440/extras/c8b61782f876f1f48e06d80a68342d88.avif?t=1752971154\" width=310 height=118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When magic is added to the chain, a &quot;CB : Chain Burst&quot; occurs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, if a magic attack hits during the chain,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the normal magic is classed up and a &quot;<strong>Chain Burst</strong>&quot; occurs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Fire]</strong> would be powered up and activated </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by another magic called <strong>[Explosion]</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this to your advantage and do a lot of